[00:01.00]Dear Friends,
[00:01.24]On behalf of the Postgraduate Association of Shanghai Jiao Tong University,
[00:07.98]I would like to extend a heartfelt welcome to all of the overseas students who will study at our university.
[00:17.22]It gives me great pleasure to make two practical suggestions to you.
[00:23.13]Life at this prestigious university may not be as relaxing as you expected.
[00:29.67]You must work hard to respond to numerous lessons,
[00:34.03]lots of homework and countless exams.
[00:37.00]In spite of all these challenges,
[00:40.25]you can still enjoy your life here.
[00:43.26]It is strongly advised that you take part in various extracurricular activities like sports meets,
[00:48.98]speech contests,
[00:50.53]social gatherings and dances,
[00:52.43]which can provide you with ample opportunities to make friends.
[00:57.04]All in all,
[00:57.97]studying at this university will be worthwhile.
[01:02.22]I hope you will enjoy yourselves here！
[01:04.10]Yours sincerely, Li Ming
[ti:1-01-建议信]
